finalSummary:
grade.py now keeps the project's --import-mode when it clears addopts. tests/test_grade.py fails on the old grader and passes on the new one.

test-reduce now:
- calls out the post-consolidation analyze and demote stage as the radical cut;
- says that parking a table's originals in probation is not stage 2;
- asks the report for the PR-tier count after each stage.

grade_plugin_eval.py resolves --python to an absolute path. Objective results for run 20260926-205004 were regenerated. With the plugin: shop-reduce PR tier 100/104/103 with 0 lost kills, vs 46/62/51 with 3 lost kills in every baseline; loyalty mutation 0.95-0.98 vs 0.83-0.90. They are recorded in the evaluation story. Delivered in the PR that closes this task.
